{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-38","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2016,"subject":"physics","number":38,"points":2.5,"unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","unitLabel":"유체·열역학","topic":"압력·단열·기체의상태","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-fluid-thermal"],"stem":"그림은 1몰의 이상 기체의 상태가 A→B→C→A를 따라 변화할 \n때 부피와 절대 온도를 나타낸 것이다. A→B 과정은 등적 과정, \nB→C 과정은 단열 과정, C→A 과정은 등온 과정이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? \n(단, 기체 상수는 R이다.) [2.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. B에서의 압력은 C에서의 8배이다.\nㄴ. A→B 과정에서 기체가 흡수한 열은 B→C 과정에서 기체가 \n한 일과 같다.\nㄷ. 한 순환 과정 동안 기체가 한 일은 3RT0ln2이다. ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":14,"height":23,"region":0,"bbox":[62.68,5.915,5.6,9.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-38/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":460,"height":320,"region":0,"bbox":[77.88,68.715,184.0,128.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-38/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":26,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[97.48,229.915,10.4,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-38/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":771,"height":227,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,258.715,308.4,90.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-38/04.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":20,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.885,759.1,551.422],"width":328.98